u who believe","root":"أيي","lem":"أَيّ"},{"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","tr":"alladhīna","en":"O you who believe"},{"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","tr":"āmanū","en":"O you who believe","root":"أمن","lem":"آمَنَ"},{"ar":"ٱجْتَنِبُوا۟","tr":"ij'tanibū","en":"Avoid","root":"جنب","lem":"اجْتَنَبُ"},{"ar":"كَثِيرًۭا","tr":"kathīran","en":"much","root":"كثر","lem":"كَثِير"},{"ar":"مِّنَ","tr":"mina","en":"of"},{"ar":"ٱلظَّنِّ","tr":"l-ẓani","en":"the assumption","root":"ظنن","lem":"ظَنّ"},{"ar":"إِنَّ","tr":"inna","en":"Indeed"},{"ar":"بَعْضَ","tr":"baʿḍa","en":"some","root":"بعض","lem":"بَعْض"},{"ar":"ٱلظَّنِّ","tr":"l-ẓani","en":"assumption","root":"ظنن","lem":"ظَنّ"},{"ar":"إِثْمٌۭ ۖ","tr":"ith'mun","en":"(is) sin","root":"أثم","lem":"إِثْم"},{"ar":"وَلَا","tr":"walā","en":"And (do) not"},{"ar":"تَجَسَّسُوا۟","tr":"tajassasū","en":"spy","root":"جسس","lem":"تَجَسَّسُ"},{"ar":"وَلَا","tr":"walā","en":"and (do) not"},{"ar":"يَغْتَب","tr":"yaghtab","en":"backbite","root":"غيب","lem":"يَغْتَب"},{"ar":"بَّعْضُكُم","tr":"baʿḍukum","en":"some of you","root":"بعض","lem":"بَعْض"},{"ar":"بَعْضًا ۚ","tr":"baʿḍan","en":"(to) others","root":"بعض","lem":"بَعْض"},{"ar":"أَيُحِبُّ","tr":"ayuḥibbu","en":"Would like","root":"حبب","lem":"أَحْبَبْ"},{"ar":"أَحَدُكُمْ","tr":"aḥadukum","en":"one of you","root":"أحد","lem":"أَحَد"},{"ar":"أَن","tr":"an","en":"to"},{"ar":"يَأْكُلَ","tr":"yakula","en":"eat","root":"أكل","lem":"أَكَلَ"},{"ar":"لَحْمَ","tr":"laḥma","en":"(the) flesh","root":"لحم","lem":"لَحْم"},{"ar":"أَخِيهِ","tr":"akhīhi","en":"(of) his brother","root":"أخو","lem":"أَخ"},{"ar":"مَيْتًۭا","tr":"maytan","en":"dead","root":"موت","lem":"مَيْت"},{"ar":"فَكَرِهْتُمُوهُ ۚ","tr":"fakarih'tumūhu","en":"Nay, you would hate it","root":"كره","lem":"كَرِهَ"},{"ar":"وَٱتَّقُوا۟","tr":"wa-ittaqū","en":"And fear Allah","root":"وقي","lem":"اتَّقَى"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهَ ۚ","tr":"l-laha","en":"And fear Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"إِنَّ","tr":"inna","en":"indeed"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","tr":"l-laha","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"تَوَّابٌۭ","tr":"tawwābun","en":"(is) Oft-Returning","root":"توب","lem":"تَوّاب"},{"ar":"رَّحِيمٌۭ","tr":"raḥīmun","en":"Most Merciful","root":"رحم","lem":"رَحِيم"}]},{"n":13,"juz":26,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلنَّاسُ إِنَّا خَلَقْنَـٰكُم مِّن ذَكَرٍ وَأُنثَىٰ وَجَعَلْنَـٰكُمْ شُعُوبًا وَقَبَآئِلَ لِتَعَارَفُوٓا۟ ۚ إِنَّ أَكْرَمَكُمْ عِندَ ٱللَّهِ أَتْقَىٰكُمْ ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ عَلِيمٌ خَبِيرٌ","en":"O mankind, indeed We have created you from male and female and made you peoples and tribes that you may know one another. Indeed, the most noble of you in the sight of Allāh is the most righteous of you. Indeed, Allāh is Knowing and Aware.","w":[{"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","tr":"yāayyuhā","en":"O mankind","root":"أيي","lem":"أَيّ"},{"ar":"ٱلنَّاسُ","tr":"l-nāsu","en":"O mankind","root":"أنس","lem":"ناس"},{"ar":"إِنَّا","tr":"innā","en":"Indeed, We"},{"ar":"خَلَقْنَـٰكُم","tr":"khalaqnākum","en":"created you","root":"خلق","lem":"خَلَقَ"},{"ar":"مِّن","tr":"min","en":"from"},{"ar":"ذَكَرٍۢ","tr":"dhakarin","en":"a male","root":"ذكر","lem":"ذَكَر"},{"ar":"وَأُنثَىٰ","tr":"wa-unthā","en":"and a female","root":"أنث","lem":"أُنثَى"},{"ar":"وَجَعَلْنَـٰكُمْ","tr":"wajaʿalnākum","en":"and We made you","root":"جعل","lem":"جَعَلَ"},{"ar":"شُعُوبًۭا","tr":"shuʿūban","en":"nations","root":"شعب","lem":"شُعُوب"},{"ar":"وَقَبَآئِلَ","tr":"waqabāila","en":"and tribes","root":"قبل","lem":"قَبائِل"},{"ar":"لِتَعَارَفُوٓا۟ ۚ","tr":"litaʿārafū","en":"that you may know one another","root":"عرف","lem":"يَتَعارَفُ"},{"ar":"إِنَّ","tr":"inna","en":"Indeed"},{"ar":"أَكْرَمَكُمْ","tr":"akramakum","en":"(the) most noble of you","root":"كرم","lem":"أَكْرَم"},{"ar":"عِندَ","tr":"ʿinda","en":"near","root":"عند","lem":"عِند"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","tr":"l-lahi","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"أَتْقَىٰكُمْ ۚ","tr":"atqākum","en":"(is the) most righteous of you","root":"وقي","lem":"أَتْقَى"},{"ar":"إِنَّ","tr":"inna","en":"Indeed"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","tr":"l-laha","en":"Alla